  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "During a sealed battle-stage spar in Shang clan city, Little Xiao cries out that big brother Wei’s Broadsword light Gu has appeared as Wei Yang chooses to charge Fang Yuan. Wei Yang has closed both hands on empty air, and two broadswords of light have taken shape there, shining brilliantly.",
