          "char_wei_yang",
          "char_fang_yuan"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "When Fang Yuan opens a sword shadow Gu, Wei Yang says that Gu is at the same level as his Broadsword light Gu and advises Fang Yuan to keep and use it rather than sell it.",
